(【23†CHEBI:63051】) is a ammonium salt (【24†CHEBI:47704】)\nL63: diammonium hydrogen phosphate (【23†CHEBI:63051】) is a inorganic phosphate (【25†CHEBI:24838】)\nL64: Incoming Relation(s)\nL65: ammonium nitrate phosphate (【26†CHEBI:147420】) has part diammonium hydrogen phosphate (【23†CHEBI:63051】)\nL66: \nL67: IUPAC Name s\nL68: ---\nL69: diammonium hydrogen phosphate\nL70: diazanium hydrogen phosphate\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn16view8 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://api-evsrest.nci.nih.gov/api/v1/concept/ncit/C61946?include=full\",\"lineno\":null}); \nURL https://api-evsrest.nci.nih.gov/api/v1/concept/ncit/C61946?include=full is not accessible via this tool."
